pageType: cover
background:
  type: solid
  color: $paper
notes: |
  开场 15 秒。一句话说清做什么：把调度员的经验固化成规则，把排车从手工劳动变成选方案。
  金句：「人做决策，机器做计算。」说完停一秒。
elements:
  - elementId: p01-rail
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [54, 70, 14, 300]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: $yellow}
    border: {color: $yellow, width: 0}
  - elementId: p01-code
    elementType: text
    bounds: [88, 48, 420, 20]
    content:
      style: $section
      text: 项目答辩 / VEHICLE DISPATCH AGENT
  - elementId: p01-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [86, 86, 560, 150]
    content:
      style: $display
      fontSize: 46
      text: |-
        车辆智能调度 Agent
        把调度经验变成规则
  - elementId: p01-subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 252, 480, 66]
    content:
      text: |-
        每天门店货量报上来以后，算出一张排车表：哪台车、跑几趟、
        上午下午分别送哪些门店、每趟装多少货，交给调度员确认下发。
      style: $body
      fontSize: 14
      color: $slate
  - elementId: p01-meta
